&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Deferred income taxes are provided for the temporary differences between the tax basis of Nautilus' assets and liabilities and the amounts reported in the financial statements. Significant components of deferred tax assets and liabilities are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
